==Strategy==
Just like the last stage, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] can solo this stage. Simply wait for the Wafer Cat BIG to attack your base and die, then send Awakened Bahamut to one-shot the Otta-smack-u and then the enemy base.

